Gaming Performance & Revenue Analysis

Project Overview

An Excel-based dashboard designed to analyze global gaming revenue, player engagement metrics, connection quality, and purchasing behavior across platforms and regions.

Key Insights

- PC leads overall platform revenue, closely followed by VR and Console.
- RPG and Survival represent the highest revenue-generating game genres.
- Asia and Latin America lead in total regional revenue and in-game purchase volume.

Tools Used

Excel | Pivot Tables | Pivot Charts | Interactive Slicers
